5. Overall recommendation

Do not proceed with production processing of real personal data. A controlled synthetic/non-personal demo may continue. Before production, approve the lawful-basis and Article 14 position, sensitive-data controls, DPIA screening, DPAs/transfers, secure gateway, retention, and rights procedures. These are pre-processing conditions.

6. What this report is not

This first-pass report is not a legal opinion, DPIA, transfer impact assessment, or certification of GDPR compliance. It is based on limited project documentation and provisional assumptions. The controller should verify the conclusions with its DPO or qualified EU privacy counsel before relying on them or processing real personal data.
